  "description": "The extraction job is configured for the **extract** phase using the **full** pattern, sourcing the data from a **CSV** file. The implementation mode is set to **single** and both the template and its metadata are version\u202f1.\n\nThe source object is the table **dbo.CustomerData** (full name\u202fdbo.CustomerData). The data will be loaded into the destination table **dw.DimCustomer** (full name\u202fdw.DimCustomer) in the data\u2011warehouse schema, with the primary\u2011key creation flag set to\u202f1. The target table includes the following columns: **CustomerKey** (int), **CustomerName** (nvarchar(100)), **Email** (nvarchar(255)) and **IsActive** (bit). The primary key column is **CustomerKey**.\n\nConnection details are as follows: the metadata repository is **MetadataDB** on server\u202fmeta.server with connection string\u202f`Server=meta.server;Database=Metadata;Trusted_Connection=True;`. Logging is handled by **LogDB** on server\u202flog.server (`Server=log.server;Database=Log;Trusted_Connection=True;`). Staging data resides in **StagingDB** on server\u202fstaging.server (`Server=staging.server;Database=Staging;Trusted_Connection=True;`). Configuration settings are stored in **ConfigDB** on server\u202fconfig.server (`Server=config.server;Database=Config;Trusted_Connection=True;`). Helper databases include **HelperDB1** (Server\u202fhelper1.server, Database\u202fHelper1, `Server=helper1.server;Database=Helper1;Trusted_Connection=True;`) and **HelperDB2** (Server\u202fhelper2.server, Database\u202fHelper2, `Server=helper2.server;Database=Helper2;Trusted_Connection=True;`).",
  "reference_json": {
    "ABI3": {
      "Template": {
        "Phase": "extract",
        "Pattern": "full",
        "Source": "csv",
        "Implementation": "single",
        "Version": 1
      },
      "Metadata": {
        "Version": 1
      }
    },
    "Object": {
      "SourceObject": {
        "Schema": "dbo",
        "Name": "CustomerData",
        "FullName": "dbo.CustomerData"
      },
      "DestinationTable": {
        "Schema": "dw",
        "Name": "DimCustomer",
        "FullName": "dw.DimCustomer",
        "CreatePrimaryKey": 1,
        "Columns": [
          {
            "Name": "CustomerKey",
            "DataType": "int"
          },
          {
            "Name": "CustomerName",
            "DataType": "nvarchar(100)"
          },
          {
            "Name": "Email",
            "DataType": "nvarchar(255)"
          },
          {
            "Name": "IsActive",
            "DataType": "bit"
          }
        ]
      },
      "PrimaryKeyColumns": [
        "CustomerKey"
      ]
    },
    "Connections": {
      "Metadata": {
        "Name": "MetadataDB",
        "Database": "Metadata",
        "ConnectionString": "Server=meta.server;Database=Metadata;Trusted_Connection=True;"
      },
      "Log": {
        "Name": "LogDB",
        "Database": "Log",
        "ConnectionString": "Server=log.server;Database=Log;Trusted_Connection=True;"
      },
      "Staging": {
